+4. **`binary-minimax-additive-constant-alln` (result 00:09:02Z) — ACCEPT**,
+   rigorous all-n theorem for the binary-order universe:
+   `(n−2)+⌈log₂ n⌉ ≤ B(n) ≤ (n−1)+⌈log₂(n−1)⌉` for `n≥3`, hence
